{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🐇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、りこぴのお誕生日でした!\nおめでとう🎊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわい!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYX578883KZR55PRNQ7A0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りこなーこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYY6779ZCCV0GEW5CBJ2T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nレッスン後にサプライズケーキがあったよ!🎂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りこぴは、すごく面白い。\nいつの間にか、自然に仲良くなりました!\n何か似たものを感じたのかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと抜けてるところが好き☺️\nサプライズを考えていると、ブログで普通に言ってしまう辺りとか。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"保乃ちゃんが前髪を直してあげてるところ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYZ5GKHZZCNY18NFSXK8M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歳が近いもの同士でもあるし、これからも仲良くやってこうね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}